      "title": "Instances and CNI",
      "items": [
        "Pick types like C5n, M5n, or R5n that offer 25 Gbps or more plus enhanced networking (SR-IOV)",
        "Use WARM_IP_TARGET and MINIMUM_IP_TARGET to cut IP allocation latency",
        "If IPs run short, attach a secondary CIDR with custom networking"
