      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "MTU and TCP",
      "items": [
        "Jumbo frames (9001 MTU) cut packet overhead, but the MTU must match along the whole path",
        "Enable TCP window scaling and consider switching congestion control to BBR",
        "Match TCP buffer sizes and keepalive values to the workload"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Placement and monitoring",
      "items": [
